   "file": "TauCeti/RepresentationTheory/Quiver/Reflection/Root.lean",
   "fix": "Expose it, e.g. `theorem dimVector_ne_zero_of_indecomposable (hM : Indecomposable M) (hfd : IsFinDim k V M) : dimVector M \u2260 0 := fun h \u21a6 hM.1 (isZero_of_dimVector_eq_zero (isFinDim_iff.mp hfd) h)`, and cite it from the docstring of `titsForm_dimVector_eq_one_of_indecomposable` where the positivity claim is made.",
